<concept otherprops="legal_eu_std_009_01" id="t00308">
	<title otherprops="legal_eu_std_009_01">Headlight leveling device</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>lighting 
					<indexterm>headlight leveling device</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
				<indexterm>headlight leveling device</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02322">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry>
							<fig id="e02323">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV035001.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e02324"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Adjust the headlight beam level according to the number of passengers and the load in the luggage area by turning the beam leveling switch.</p>
		<p>The higher the number on the switch, the lower the headlight beam level. Always keep the headlights properly leveled to avoid dazzling other road users.</p>
		<p>Below are examples of recommended switch settings. For loading conditions not listed, adjust the switch to achieve a beam level closest to the listed conditions.</p>
		<table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="1.606*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="0.638*"/>
				<thead>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<p>Loading condition</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<p>Switch position</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Driver only</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>0</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Driver + Front passenger</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>0</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Full passengers (including driver)</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>1</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Full passengers (including driver) + Maximum permissible loading</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>2</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Driver + Maximum permissible loading</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>3</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
	</conbody>
